# The Battle Tower from the Battle Frontier (decomp scripts_battle_tower.s): through the doors into the lobby; its
# onTransition runs (Teala hidden: no trophy is due, scr_cmd_1e0 0), then the single attendant's welcome, the
# CHALLENGE / INFO / EXIT menu, EXIT and the goodbye.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 60 platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_BATTLE_FRONTIER 48 19 up
until idle
+0 press up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_BATTLE_TOWER" 300
+0 release up
until idle 600
+0 assert map platinum:MAP_HEADER_BATTLE_TOWER
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_BATTLE_TOWER_TEALA true
+0 press up
until position 15 6 600
+0 release up
until idle 300
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until menu 600
+10 press b
+1 release b
advance text 600
